cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "eu-pd-composers: EU public-domain estimates for 20th-century classical composers and their works on IMSLP"
abstract: >-
  A versioned dataset of 3,369 twentieth-century classical composers and 29,033
  IMSLP works, with an EU life-plus-70 public-domain estimate. Composer and work
  metadata are drawn from Wikipedia, Wikidata and IMSLP. The estimate is a
  heuristic, not legal advice.
